{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 9.152,
"text": "Which brings us back to 2019, and that petition. Matt Reeves wanted him for Batman. A big part of the internet wanted anyone else.",
"end": 9.427
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 9.427,
"vo_start": 9.702,
"vo_end": 19.548,
"text": "The Batman came out in March 2022. Rain-soaked, slow, gloomy, and very good. It made about seven hundred and seventy million dollars worldwide.",
"end": 19.823
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 19.823,
"vo_start": 20.098,
"vo_end": 28.933,
"text": "The petition crowd went quiet. Some of them even started calling him Battinson. The doubters had been proven wrong in front of the whole world.",
"end": 29.208
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 29.208,
"vo_start": 29.483,
"vo_end": 38.083,
"text": "A sequel, The Batman Part Two, has been delayed again and again, and is now due in February 2028. Remember that date, because it becomes a problem.",
"end": 39.033
}
],
